        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "feat: add ClawRouter usage provider",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- add ClawRouter as a first-class API usage provider with settings, CLI aliases, icon, cache support, and documentation\n- show monthly budget/spend plus aggregate request/token counts and arbitrary routed-provider breakdowns\n- support `CLAWROUTER_API_KEY`, `CLAWROUTER_BASE_URL`, and validated HTTPS endpoint overrides without persisting policy identifiers\n- render complete ClawRouter text CLI detail for both budgeted and unmetered policies, including zero-spend policies without a bogus zero-limit denominator\n\n## Live proof\n\n- smoke policy returned a monthly budget plus successful request/token usage\n- packaged debug app fetched and displayed the live policy using the normal settings/menu path\n- exact candidate CLI fetched the live smoke policy with a credential injected only inside isolated tmux; spend, aggregate usage, and routed-provider lines were present, while ` / 0.0` was absent\n\n## Screenshots\n\n| Usage menu | Provider settings |\n| --- | --- |\n| ![ClawRouter usage menu](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/steipete/CodexBar/feat/clawrouter-provider/docs/screenshots/clawrouter-usage.png) | ![ClawRouter provider settings](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/steipete/CodexBar/feat/clawrouter-provider/docs/screenshots/clawrouter-settings.png) |\n\n## Review fixes\n\n- fixed unmetered text output that previously rendered `Cost: used / 0.0`\n- fixed budgeted text output that previously omitted spend, request/token totals, result counts, and routed providers\n- added regression coverage for budgeted, unmetered, and zero-spend output\n\n## Validation\n\n- exact candidate: `7e5ed1f2305f460d7ba26ff47ac97e63096e367e`\n- `swift test --filter ClawRouterUsageFetcherTests` (10 tests)\n- `make check`\n- `make test` (46/46 shards)\n- autoreview: clean, no accepted/actionable findings (0.86)\n",
